    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel must:",
      "source_hash": 17964202128174828959,
      "context_hash": 2914413594764519588,
      "translation": "커널은 다음을 수행해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:50.356184Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:28/seg:0",
      "source": "**Identify** which memory node belongs to which tier",
      "source_hash": 4991750259114893628,
      "context_hash": 13425827334983149430,
      "translation": "어떤 메모리 노드가 어떤 티어에 속하는지 **식별**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리",
        "node": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:50.356185Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:29/seg:0",
      "source": "**Place** hot pages on fast memory, cold pages on slow memory",
      "source_hash": 3508110162713799171,
      "context_hash": 4330024842748987429,
      "translation": "핫 페이지는 빠른 메모리에, 콜드 페이지는 느린 메모리에 **배치**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:31:50.356185Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:30/seg:0",
      "source": "**Promote** cold pages that become hot",
      "source_hash": 12067348255482569066,
      "context_hash": 4614120052043113720,
      "translation": "뜨거워진 콜드 페이지를 **승격**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748861Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:31/seg:0",
      "source": "**Demote** hot pages that go cold (under memory pressure)",
      "source_hash": 2074191150775635145,
      "context_hash": 12792236113358901761,
      "translation": "차가워진 핫 페이지를 (메모리 압박 시) **강등**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748862Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Memory tiers",
      "source_hash": 13758843439193637379,
      "context_hash": 836839384942899919,
      "translation": "메모리 계층",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748862Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Tier discovery",
      "source_hash": 17913837541505253705,
      "context_hash": 325830919580907775,
      "translation": "계층 탐색",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748862Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Page demotion",
      "source_hash": 4429025728700636333,
      "context_hash": 2541515163000034347,
      "translation": "페이지 강등",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "demotion": "강등"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748862Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When fast memory is under pressure, the kernel demotes cold pages to slow memory nodes:",
      "source_hash": 15051622515346131174,
      "context_hash": 14706569280735324736,
      "translation": "빠른 메모리에 압박이 가해지면 커널은 콜드 페이지를 느린 메모리 노드로 강등합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "nodes": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748862Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Page promotion",
      "source_hash": 1134107959496849580,
      "context_hash": 2565943208202421931,
      "translation": "페이지 승격",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748863Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a page on slow memory is frequently accessed, NUMA Balancing or the tier migration daemon can promote it to fast memory:",
      "source_hash": 11519687623639757746,
      "context_hash": 7407697882785494469,
      "translation": "느린 메모리에 있는 페이지에 자주 접근하면 NUMA 밸런싱이나 티어 마이그레이션 데몬이 해당 페이지를 빠른 메모리로 승격할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NUMA balancing": "NUMA 밸런싱",
        "daemon": "데몬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:49.187726Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Explicit promotion via memory_tier sysfs",
      "source_hash": 9307030488009782871,
      "context_hash": 3616420331064735677,
      "translation": "memory_tier sysfs를 통한 명시적 승격",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "sysfs": "sysfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748863Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Tiered memory allocation",
      "source_hash": 16876836156886114293,
      "context_hash": 3667910193736340934,
      "translation": "계층형 메모리 할당",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory allocation": "메모리 할당"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748864Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel allocates from faster tiers first, falling back to slower:",
      "source_hash": 1164214837421352790,
      "context_hash": 17824017358781719720,
      "translation": "커널은 더 빠른 계층에서 먼저 할당하고, 실패하면 더 느린 계층으로 폴백합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748864Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The zonelist order is set by `build_zonelists()` which considers NUMA distance.",
      "source_hash": 15546878248357212566,
      "context_hash": 1881393152579646225,
      "translation": "zonelist 순서는 NUMA 거리를 고려하는 `build_zonelists()`가 설정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "NUMA": "NUMA",
        "zonelist": "zonelist"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748864Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "With memory tiers, CXL memory at distance 300 is listed after DRAM at distance 200.",
      "source_hash": 1150758953705550944,
      "context_hash": 9903571901741843968,
      "translation": "메모리 계층이 있으면 거리 300의 CXL 메모리가 거리 200의 DRAM 뒤에 나열됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CXL": "CXL",
        "DRAM": "DRAM",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748864Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "CXL (Compute Express Link) memory",
      "source_hash": 9649813691911004292,
      "context_hash": 763194075461379632,
      "translation": "CXL (Compute Express Link) 메모리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CXL": "CXL",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748864Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "CXL is a PCIe-based memory expansion standard that allows attaching DRAM at higher latency than on-package DDR:",
      "source_hash": 10942161910754324095,
      "context_hash": 7168430128376642973,
      "translation": "CXL은 온패키지 DDR보다 높은 지연 시간으로 DRAM을 연결할 수 있게 해 주는 PCIe 기반 메모리 확장 표준입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CXL": "CXL",
        "DRAM": "DRAM",
        "PCIe": "PCIe",
        "latency": "지연 시간",
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748865Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "PMEM (Persistent Memory)",
      "source_hash": 5236957701005271283,
      "context_hash": 1945796166908158447,
      "translation": "PMEM (Persistent Memory)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:05:19.748865Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Optane DIMM and future persistent memory devices:",
      "source_hash": 5319421072182533368,
      "context_hash": 2028117081444335435,
      "translation": "Optane DIMM 및 향후 등장할 영구 메모리(persistent memory) 디바이스:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "devices": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:31:49.187727Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NUMA migration policies",
